{"id":"75e696732042abd2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-polynomial-hierarchy.md","title":"Polynomial Hierarchy with Binary Inputs","display":"df-polynomial-hierarchy — Polynomial Hierarchy with Binary Inputs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy","aliases":["72-df-polynomial-hierarchy"],"display":"df-polynomial-hierarchy — Polynomial Hierarchy with Binary Inputs","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.3.4; §1.3.6","source_printed_pages":"103–106","source_pdf_pages":"115–118","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-polynomial-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-hierarchy — Polynomial Hierarchy with Binary Inputs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.3.4; §1.3.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"103–106"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"115–118"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>算术语言、项、变量支持、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 与标准项解释取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,r,i\\in\\omega\">\\(k,r,i\\in\\omega\\)</span>；下标递归中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge1\">\\(i\\ge1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega[X]\">\\(\\omega[X]\\)</span> 是自然数系数多项式集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_j:=v_j\">\\(x_j:=v_j\\)</span>。关系是带元数的对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(r,R)\">\\((r,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^r\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^r\\)</span>；空oracle对全部查询回答否。</li>\n<li>二进制串为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^*:=\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbb B^*:=\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，有限串取函数序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为串接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^j\">\\(1^j\\)</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的全1串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(n)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(n)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时为空，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 时为首位1、数值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的唯一二进制串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{unpack}\">\\(\\operatorname{unpack}\\)</span> 的非法输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dagger\">\\(\\dagger\\)</span> 不属于任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^r\">\\(\\omega^r\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式机器有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\ge3\">\\(\\ell\\ge3\\)</span> 条双向磁带；第0、1、2条分别兼作输入、查询、输出带。有限字母表为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\{0,\\ldots,a-1\\}\">\\(a=\\{0,\\ldots,a-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\ge3\">\\(a\\ge3\\)</span>，空白为2；状态集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}\">\\(q=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\ge3\">\\(q\\ge3\\)</span>，初态0、停机态1、查询态2。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_Y,q_N\">\\(q_Y,q_N\\)</span> 是机器描述的分量；所有转移表都是有限函数。</li>\n<li>配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\langle u,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(c=\\langle u,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 为状态，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec h\\in\\mathbb Z^\\ell\">\\(\\vec h\\in\\mathbb Z^\\ell\\)</span>，每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j:\\mathbb Z\\to a\">\\(T_j:\\mathbb Z\\to a\\)</span> 只有有限个非空白位置。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T[h\\leftarrow b]\">\\(T[h\\leftarrow b]\\)</span> 是函数图在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 处的单点更新；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{read}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{read}(T)\\)</span> 从位置0读取到首个非二进制符号之前。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\\notin\\omega\">\\(\\infty\\notin\\omega\\)</span> 为未停机结果，且大于所有自然数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Out}_R,\\mathsf{Time}_R\">\\(\\mathsf{Out}_R,\\mathsf{Time}_R\\)</span> 以下式运行递归为定义，不调用外部机器文件。oracle调用计一步，写出查询串所需步骤计入时间。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>；函数参数中的自然数元组始终使用有限函数序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{num}(w)&amp;:=\\sum_{j&lt;|w|}w_j2^{|w|-1-j},\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}(0)&amp;:=\\epsilon,\\quad\\operatorname{bin}(n):=\\iota w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\ (|w|&gt;0\\land w_0=1\\land\\operatorname{num}(w)=n)\\quad(n&gt;0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n)&amp;:=1^k\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\mathop{\\frown}_{j&lt;k}(1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(n_j)|}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{bin}(n_j)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}(w)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\vec n,&amp;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\ \\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\land w=\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n),\\\\\\dagger,&amp;w\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pack}),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tape}_a&amp;:=\\{T\\in a^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{h\\in\\mathbb Z:T(h)\\ne2\\}|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{tape}(w)(h)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}w_h,&amp;0\\le h&lt;|w|,\\\\2,&amp;h&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le h,\\end{cases}\\\\\nT[h\\leftarrow b]&amp;:=(T\\restriction(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle h,b\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{read}(T)&amp;:=T\\restriction\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:T(j)\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{OTM}&amp;:=\\{\\langle q,a,\\ell,\\delta,q_Y,q_N\\rangle:q,a,\\ell\\in\\omega\\land q,a,\\ell\\ge3\\land q_Y,q_N\\in q\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\delta:(q\\setminus\\{1,2\\})\\times a^\\ell\\to q\\times a^\\ell\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^\\ell\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M&amp;:=q\\times\\mathbb Z^\\ell\\times\\operatorname{Tape}_a^\\ell,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Init}_M(\\vec n)&amp;:=\\langle0,\\langle0\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell},\\langle T_j\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell}\\rangle,\\quad\nT_0:=\\operatorname{tape}(\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n)),\\quad T_j:=\\operatorname{tape}(\\epsilon)\\ (0&lt;j&lt;\\ell),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}_R^M(c)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\nc,&amp;u=1,\\\\\n\\langle q_Y,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,&amp;u=2\\land\\operatorname{unpack}(\\operatorname{read}(T_1))\\in R,\\\\\n\\langle q_N,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,&amp;u=2\\land\\operatorname{unpack}(\\operatorname{read}(T_1))\\notin R,\\\\\n\\langle u&#39;,\\langle h_j+d_j\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell},\\langle T_j[h_j\\leftarrow b_j]\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell}\\rangle,\n&amp;u\\notin\\{1,2\\}\\land\\delta(u,\\langle T_j(h_j)\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell})=\\langle u&#39;,\\vec b,\\vec d\\rangle,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,0)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Init}_M(\\vec n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t+1)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Step}_R^M(\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)),\\\\\nH_R^M(\\vec n)&amp;:=\\{t\\in\\omega:\\exists\\vec h,\\vec T\\ \\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)=\\langle1,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\min H_R^M(\\vec n),&amp;H_R^M(\\vec n)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\\infty,&amp;H_R^M(\\vec n)=\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{Out}_R(M,\\vec n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{num}(\\operatorname{read}(T_2)),&amp;\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)=t\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)=\\langle1,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,\\\\\\infty,&amp;\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)=\\infty.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{num}(w)&amp;:=\\sum_{j&lt;|w|}w_j2^{|w|-1-j},\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}(0)&amp;:=\\epsilon,\\quad\\operatorname{bin}(n):=\\iota w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\ (|w|&gt;0\\land w_0=1\\land\\operatorname{num}(w)=n)\\quad(n&gt;0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n)&amp;:=1^k\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\mathop{\\frown}_{j&lt;k}(1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(n_j)|}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{bin}(n_j)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}(w)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\vec n,&amp;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\ \\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\land w=\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n),\\\\\\dagger,&amp;w\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pack}),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tape}_a&amp;:=\\{T\\in a^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{h\\in\\mathbb Z:T(h)\\ne2\\}|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{tape}(w)(h)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}w_h,&amp;0\\le h&lt;|w|,\\\\2,&amp;h&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le h,\\end{cases}\\\\\nT[h\\leftarrow b]&amp;:=(T\\restriction(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle h,b\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{read}(T)&amp;:=T\\restriction\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:T(j)\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{OTM}&amp;:=\\{\\langle q,a,\\ell,\\delta,q_Y,q_N\\rangle:q,a,\\ell\\in\\omega\\land q,a,\\ell\\ge3\\land q_Y,q_N\\in q\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\delta:(q\\setminus\\{1,2\\})\\times a^\\ell\\to q\\times a^\\ell\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^\\ell\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M&amp;:=q\\times\\mathbb Z^\\ell\\times\\operatorname{Tape}_a^\\ell,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Init}_M(\\vec n)&amp;:=\\langle0,\\langle0\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell},\\langle T_j\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell}\\rangle,\\quad\nT_0:=\\operatorname{tape}(\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n)),\\quad T_j:=\\operatorname{tape}(\\epsilon)\\ (0&lt;j&lt;\\ell),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}_R^M(c)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\nc,&amp;u=1,\\\\\n\\langle q_Y,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,&amp;u=2\\land\\operatorname{unpack}(\\operatorname{read}(T_1))\\in R,\\\\\n\\langle q_N,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,&amp;u=2\\land\\operatorname{unpack}(\\operatorname{read}(T_1))\\notin R,\\\\\n\\langle u&#39;,\\langle h_j+d_j\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell},\\langle T_j[h_j\\leftarrow b_j]\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell}\\rangle,\n&amp;u\\notin\\{1,2\\}\\land\\delta(u,\\langle T_j(h_j)\\rangle_{j&lt;\\ell})=\\langle u&#39;,\\vec b,\\vec d\\rangle,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,0)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Init}_M(\\vec n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t+1)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Step}_R^M(\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)),\\\\\nH_R^M(\\vec n)&amp;:=\\{t\\in\\omega:\\exists\\vec h,\\vec T\\ \\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)=\\langle1,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\min H_R^M(\\vec n),&amp;H_R^M(\\vec n)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\\infty,&amp;H_R^M(\\vec n)=\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{Out}_R(M,\\vec n)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{num}(\\operatorname{read}(T_2)),&amp;\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)=t\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)=\\langle1,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,\\\\\\infty,&amp;\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)=\\infty.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\|\\vec n\\|:=k+\\sum_{j&lt;k}\\lambda(n_j),\\qquad\n\\chi_R(\\vec n):=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec n\\in R,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec n\\notin R.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\|\\vec n\\|:=k+\\sum_{j&lt;k}\\lambda(n_j),\\qquad\n\\chi_R(\\vec n):=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec n\\in R,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec n\\notin R.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{FP}_k(R):=\\{f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega:\\;&amp;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{OTM}\\;\\exists p\\in\\omega[X]\\;\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\\\\n&amp;[\\mathsf{Out}_R(M,\\vec n)=f(\\vec n)\\land\n\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)\\leq p(\\|\\vec n\\|)]\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf P_k(R)&amp;:=\\{Q\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_Q\\in\\mathbf{FP}_k(R)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{FP}(\\mathcal C)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\ \\bigcup_{(r,R)\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf{FP}_k(R),\\\\\n\\mathbf P(\\mathcal C)&amp;:=\\{(k,Q):\\exists(r,R)\\in\\mathcal C\\;(Q\\in\\mathbf P_k(R))\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_1^p&amp;:=\\{(k,Q):Q\\in\\mathbf P_k(\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_0^p:=\\Delta_1^p,\\qquad\\Pi_0^p:=\\Delta_1^p.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{FP}_k(R):=\\{f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega:\\;&amp;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{OTM}\\;\\exists p\\in\\omega[X]\\;\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\\\\n&amp;[\\mathsf{Out}_R(M,\\vec n)=f(\\vec n)\\land\n\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)\\leq p(\\|\\vec n\\|)]\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf P_k(R)&amp;:=\\{Q\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_Q\\in\\mathbf{FP}_k(R)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{FP}(\\mathcal C)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\ \\bigcup_{(r,R)\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf{FP}_k(R),\\\\\n\\mathbf P(\\mathcal C)&amp;:=\\{(k,Q):\\exists(r,R)\\in\\mathcal C\\;(Q\\in\\mathbf P_k(R))\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_1^p&amp;:=\\{(k,Q):Q\\in\\mathbf P_k(\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_0^p:=\\Delta_1^p,\\qquad\\Pi_0^p:=\\Delta_1^p.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_i^p:=\\{(k,R):\\;&amp;R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\land\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}\\\\\n&amp;[(k+1,Q)\\in\\Delta_i^p\\land\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\leq t^{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}}(\\vec n)\\;\\vec n\\frown\\langle y\\rangle\\in Q)]\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_i^p&amp;:=\\{(k,\\omega^k\\setminus R):(k,R)\\in\\Sigma_i^p\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_{i+1}^p&amp;:=\\mathbf P(\\Sigma_i^p),\\qquad\n\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p}:=\\mathbf{FP}(\\Sigma_{i-1}^p)\\qquad(i\\geq1).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_i^p:=\\{(k,R):\\;&amp;R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\land\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}\\\\\n&amp;[(k+1,Q)\\in\\Delta_i^p\\land\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\leq t^{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}}(\\vec n)\\;\\vec n\\frown\\langle y\\rangle\\in Q)]\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_i^p&amp;:=\\{(k,\\omega^k\\setminus R):(k,R)\\in\\Sigma_i^p\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_{i+1}^p&amp;:=\\mathbf P(\\Sigma_i^p),\\qquad\n\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p}:=\\mathbf{FP}(\\Sigma_{i-1}^p)\\qquad(i\\geq1).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>机器运行和非法查询均已显式给定。有限支撑保证read遇到非二进制符号；转移保持有限支撑；递归运行存在唯一。pack可唯一解析，其长度为1+2‖n⃗‖，因此没有以单位代价读取任意长输入。输出按二进制数值解释，空输出为零。原有PH层级递归及算术项界保持不变；这里只补全此前作为外部约定使用的计算模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"算术语言、项、变量支持、$\\lambda$ 与标准项解释取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]。$k,r,i\\in\\omega$；下标递归中 $i\\ge1$。$\\omega[X]$ 是自然数系数多项式集合。$x_j:=v_j$。关系是带元数的对 $(r,R)$，$R\\subseteq\\omega^r$；空oracle对全部查询回答否。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"k,r,i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega[X]","display":false},{"tex":"x_j:=v_j","display":false},{"tex":"(r,R)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^*:=\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"1^j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{unpack}","display":false},{"tex":"\\dagger","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\ge3","display":false},{"tex":"a=\\{0,\\ldots,a-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\ge3","display":false},{"tex":"q=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\ge3","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"q_Y,q_N","display":false},{"tex":"c=\\langle u,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec h\\in\\mathbb Z^\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"T_j:\\mathbb Z\\to a","display":false},{"tex":"T[h\\leftarrow b]","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{read}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty\\notin\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Out}_R,\\mathsf{Time}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec n\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{num}(w)&:=\\sum_{j<|w|}w_j2^{|w|-1-j},\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}(0)&:=\\epsilon,\\quad\\operatorname{bin}(n):=\\iota w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\ (|w|>0\\land w_0=1\\land\\operatorname{num}(w)=n)\\quad(n>0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n)&:=1^k\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\mathop{\\frown}_{j<k}(1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(n_j)|}\\frown\\langle0\\rangle\\frown\\operatorname{bin}(n_j)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}(w)&:=\\begin{cases}\\vec n,&\\exists k\\in\\omega\\ \\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\land w=\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n),\\\\\\dagger,&w\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pack}),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tape}_a&:=\\{T\\in a^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{h\\in\\mathbb Z:T(h)\\ne2\\}|<\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{tape}(w)(h)&:=\\begin{cases}w_h,&0\\le h<|w|,\\\\2,&h<0\\lor |w|\\le h,\\end{cases}\\\\\nT[h\\leftarrow b]&:=(T\\restriction(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle h,b\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{read}(T)&:=T\\restriction\\min\\{j\\in\\omega:T(j)\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{OTM}&:=\\{\\langle q,a,\\ell,\\delta,q_Y,q_N\\rangle:q,a,\\ell\\in\\omega\\land q,a,\\ell\\ge3\\land q_Y,q_N\\in q\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\delta:(q\\setminus\\{1,2\\})\\times a^\\ell\\to q\\times a^\\ell\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^\\ell\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M&:=q\\times\\mathbb Z^\\ell\\times\\operatorname{Tape}_a^\\ell,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Init}_M(\\vec n)&:=\\langle0,\\langle0\\rangle_{j<\\ell},\\langle T_j\\rangle_{j<\\ell}\\rangle,\\quad\nT_0:=\\operatorname{tape}(\\operatorname{pack}(\\vec n)),\\quad T_j:=\\operatorname{tape}(\\epsilon)\\ (0<j<\\ell),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}_R^M(c)&:=\\begin{cases}\nc,&u=1,\\\\\n\\langle q_Y,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,&u=2\\land\\operatorname{unpack}(\\operatorname{read}(T_1))\\in R,\\\\\n\\langle q_N,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,&u=2\\land\\operatorname{unpack}(\\operatorname{read}(T_1))\\notin R,\\\\\n\\langle u',\\langle h_j+d_j\\rangle_{j<\\ell},\\langle T_j[h_j\\leftarrow b_j]\\rangle_{j<\\ell}\\rangle,\n&u\\notin\\{1,2\\}\\land\\delta(u,\\langle T_j(h_j)\\rangle_{j<\\ell})=\\langle u',\\vec b,\\vec d\\rangle,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,0)&:=\\operatorname{Init}_M(\\vec n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t+1)&:=\\operatorname{Step}_R^M(\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)),\\\\\nH_R^M(\\vec n)&:=\\{t\\in\\omega:\\exists\\vec h,\\vec T\\ \\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)=\\langle1,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)&:=\\begin{cases}\\min H_R^M(\\vec n),&H_R^M(\\vec n)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\\infty,&H_R^M(\\vec n)=\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{Out}_R(M,\\vec n)&:=\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{num}(\\operatorname{read}(T_2)),&\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)=t\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Run}_R^M(\\vec n,t)=\\langle1,\\vec h,\\vec T\\rangle,\\\\\\infty,&\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)=\\infty.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\|\\vec n\\|:=k+\\sum_{j<k}\\lambda(n_j),\\qquad\n\\chi_R(\\vec n):=\\begin{cases}1,&\\vec n\\in R,\\\\0,&\\vec n\\notin R.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{FP}_k(R):=\\{f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega:\\;&\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{OTM}\\;\\exists p\\in\\omega[X]\\;\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\\\\n&[\\mathsf{Out}_R(M,\\vec n)=f(\\vec n)\\land\n\\mathsf{Time}_R(M,\\vec n)\\leq p(\\|\\vec n\\|)]\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf P_k(R)&:=\\{Q\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_Q\\in\\mathbf{FP}_k(R)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{FP}(\\mathcal C)&:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\ \\bigcup_{(r,R)\\in\\mathcal C}\\mathbf{FP}_k(R),\\\\\n\\mathbf P(\\mathcal C)&:=\\{(k,Q):\\exists(r,R)\\in\\mathcal C\\;(Q\\in\\mathbf P_k(R))\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_1^p&:=\\{(k,Q):Q\\in\\mathbf P_k(\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_0^p:=\\Delta_1^p,\\qquad\\Pi_0^p:=\\Delta_1^p.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_i^p:=\\{(k,R):\\;&R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\land\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}\\\\\n&[(k+1,Q)\\in\\Delta_i^p\\land\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\leq t^{\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}}(\\vec n)\\;\\vec n\\frown\\langle y\\rangle\\in Q)]\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_i^p&:=\\{(k,\\omega^k\\setminus R):(k,R)\\in\\Sigma_i^p\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_{i+1}^p&:=\\mathbf P(\\Sigma_i^p),\\qquad\n\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p}:=\\mathbf{FP}(\\Sigma_{i-1}^p)\\qquad(i\\geq1).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":7034,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy|df-polynomial-hierarchy — Polynomial Hierarchy with Binary Inputs]]"},{"id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FP}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PTIME}_2$ 使用 [[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]] 的显式机器模型，按下式转为串函数和二元串关系。多项式具有非负整数系数。$\\operatorname{num}$ 为该依赖的二进制数值函数。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-polynomial-hierarchy|df-polynomial-hierarchy — Polynomial Hierarchy with Binary Inputs]]"},{"id":"a04488efdf405cc2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 是标准结构，$\\Sigma_i^p,\\Pi_i^p$ 是按二进制输入与元数记录的关系类（[[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]]）。"},{"id":"58e12abc814f8c50","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 是标准自然数结构；$\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p},\\Delta_i^p$ 取 [[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]]。"}],"outgoing":["5635e2f9f2823a2f"]}